; AmiBroker ASCII import format for the Banyu Langit export.
;
; The OLE Import() call passes this file explicitly, so it does NOT have to live in
; C:\Program Files\AmiBroker\Formats - which a normal user cannot write to.
;
; Column order MUST match server/scripts/export-amibroker.js:
;   Ticker,YYYY-MM-DD,Open,High,Low,Close,Volume
;
; $BREAKONERR 1 is deliberate: without it a rejected line is skipped silently, Import()
; reports no error, and the database stays empty while the script prints "ok". A gate that
; cannot go red is worse than no gate.
;
; $OVERWRITE is NOT set: it belongs to symbol-information imports ($NOQUOTES), not quotes.

$FORMAT Ticker,Date_YMD,Open,High,Low,Close,Volume
$SEPARATOR ,
$SKIPLINES 0
$AUTOADD 1
$BREAKONERR 1
$DEBUG 1
